*An evil creature appears in the [[Bloodstone Mines]] in [[Damara]], killing hundreds of miners and bringing its [[bloodstone]] mining operation, responsible for almost half of Damara's bloodstone revenue, to a halt.<ref name="BL-p4">{{Cite book/The Bloodstone Lands|4}}</ref>
